{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeDebugging-12470": "KERAUNOS: 想看哪段石阵场景？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeDebugging-12471": "不看",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-hengeDebugging-12488": "头目战后的崩塌",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-pitDebugging-12489": "KERAUNOS: 想看哪段坑底场景？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-pitDebugging-12490": "不看",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-pitDebugging-12491": "先设置第十一章队伍",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-pitDebugging-12492": "跳转至格吕亨德",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-pitDebugging-12517": "传送至棱镜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12518": "BEN: 我们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12519": "BEN: 那是出口？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12520": "CORDELIA: 是。解开石阵封印后，这条路应该就显现了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12521": "CORDELIA: 改造这里的人，给自己留了条出路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12522": "BEN: 跟这噩梦说再见吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12523": "NIKOLAI: 等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12524": "NIKOLAI: 那个和我们一起在这里的东西呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12525": "CORDELIA: 留在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12526": "AGATA: 束缚法术都没了，也不管？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12527": "CORDELIA: 星界石阵的束缚是解开了，可那个生物的契约是否解除，还不清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12528": "CORDELIA: 它既然没试着阻止我们，就一定仍受契约约束。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12529": "ALEXANDRA: “契约”是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12530": "CORDELIA: 分散时，这里的生物轻易就能逐个除掉我们，可它没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12531": "CORDELIA: 所以，它必然与某位强大法师订有契约，法师不许它杀我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12532": "CORDELIA: 或许是想亲自动手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12533": "NIKOLAI: 那我更想除掉它了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12534": "AGATA: 同意。魔法和魔法生物最大的危险，就是意料之外的后果。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12535": "ALEXANDRA: 所以……得在它自己家里杀了它？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12536": "AGATA: 元素灵杀不死，只能打散。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12537": "AGATA: 就像清理蔓生的杂草。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12538": "CORDELIA: 非做不可的话，记住，任何古老生物都不能轻视。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismDilemma-12539": "CORDELIA: 我们靠近它的藏身处，它宁愿冒违反契约受罚的风险，也不会任由自己被毁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpEntrance-12540": "传送至迷宫入口？（随时可以传送回来。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpEntrance-12541": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpEntrance-12542": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpPrism-12543": "传送至格吕亨德洞窟尽头？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpPrism-12544": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarpPrism-12545": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks1-12546": "<align=center>人类……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks1-12547": "<align=center>当我还是风，当我还是火……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks1-12548": "<align=center>我可以随心而存在。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks2-12549": "<align=center>可那些人类……还有他们自命不凡的国王与王后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks2-12550": "<align=center>他们下令，火必须被驯服，风必须套上枷锁……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks2-12551": "<align=center>他们把我们束缚在血肉之中，又为此诅咒我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks3-12552": "<align=center>至少这座监狱让我得以沉睡，远离他们的规则与束缚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks3-12553": "<align=center>可后来，来了一个人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderSpeaks3-12554": "<align=center>他搜遍世界，不放过任何能据为己有的力量。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderConfrontation-12555": "GLUHENDER: 想打散我，那就来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderConfrontation-12556": "GLUHENDER: 可在那之前，你们得先还清这笔账。我族受了几千年的屈辱，都是拜你们所赐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12557": "FORTUNE TELLER: 想看哪段场景？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12558": "石阵场景",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12559": "FORTUNE TELLER: 想看哪组搭档？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12560": "不看",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12577": "坑底场景",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12578": "FORTUNE TELLER: 想看哪组搭档？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12579": "不看",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderReviewScenes-12604": "不看",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluReviewIntro-12605": "FORTUNE TELLER: 啊……你们回来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluReviewIntro-12606": "FORTUNE TELLER: 显然我如今对你们算不上威胁了，就省掉道歉吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluReviewIntro-12607": "FORTUNE TELLER: 是为那座魔法洞穴的幻象来的？是吗？好吧，它们……折磨得我不轻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12608": "AGATA: 消散了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12609": "NIKOLAI: 好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12610": "CORDELIA: 走吧。这里值得研究的东西，如今都成了一堆碎石。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12611": "ALEXANDRA: 咱们能不能探完这个山洞，就再也别去了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12612": "JUNA: 我赞成。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12613": "ALEXANDRA: 下一个幽灵、精怪、恶魔，随便什么……要是在一家特别好的面包店里，我就去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12614": "ALEXANDRA: 否则，山洞我真的受够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12615": "BEN: 完全有道理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12616": "JUNA: 是啊，真奇怪。强大的生物怎么就不肯挑一片阳光明媚的草地？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12617": "BEN: 我要是邪恶将军，就坐在葡萄架下最舒服的椅子上，统治我的王国。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12618": "JEROME: 我在想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12619": "JEROME: 古斯塔夫·海泽想必用了近一百五十年追求力量。不然，那些年他都在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12620": "AGATA: 他什么时候开始从政的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12621": "NIKOLAI: 哦，呃……看你从什么时候算。反正我小时候，几乎没人听过他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12622": "NIKOLAI: 应该编过新身份吧，或许还不止一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12623": "NIKOLAI: 他们说，他参加过上次战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12624": "JEROME: 那么多年，他还可能发现过什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12625": "CORDELIA: 不管找到过什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12626": "CORDELIA: 都比不上那些狂热拥护他的人可怕。就连那些暴行，他们也甘愿替他去做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12627": "CORDELIA: 我们在这里的事，确实都办完了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-prismRevamp-12628": "ZIKARON: ……帝国……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarning-12629": "NIKOLAI: 确定准备好了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarning-12630": "还没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluhenderWarning-12631": "走吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderPumpInteract-12632": "先用完现有的水，再抽吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderTroffDrain-12633": "先用完现有的水，再抽吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderTroffDrain-12634": "可以用水泵取水。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderTroffDrain-12635": "水不够了，用水泵吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderTroffDrain-12636": "剩余 {0} 次",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderLibaryBookPlace-12637": "放哪本书？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderLibaryBookPlace-12638": "<color=#67c82f>地</color>之书",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderLibaryBookPlace-12639": "<color=#bfb100>风</color>之书",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderLibaryBookPlace-12640": "<color=#ff4532>火</color>之书",
