  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderLibaryBookPlace-12643": "这里可以放一本书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderBookPuzzlePickUpBook-12644": "拿起<color=#67c82f>地</color>之书",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderBookPuzzlePickUpBook-12645": "拿起<color=#bfb100>风</color>之书",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhenderPuzzles.yarn-gluhenderBookPuzzlePickUpBook-12646": "拿起<color=#ff4532>火</color>之书",
